==Trivia==
*The purple skin on the Baby Dragon's back makes it appear as if it's growing into the [[w:c:clashofclans:Dragon|Dragon]] from Clash of Clans.
**Although, In the "[[w:c:clasharama:Clash-A-Rama!|Clash-A-Rama!]]" episode "[https://youtu.be/GncXJbwaoZk?si=oSuaE3Z9Eu4WEqdJ&t=292 Bringing Up Baby Dragon]" it's shown that Baby Dragons mature into a different Dragon than the ones in Clash of Clans. So, this is just an allusion.

